Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.31,0:00:49.42,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Cutremur!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.49,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Fugiți!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.96,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Mina se prăbușește!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.72,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Fugiți!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:03.71,0:01:04.73,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Se prăbușește!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.31,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Fugiți! Se prăbușește!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.35,0:01:12.43,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Fugiți! Se prăbușește!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.31,Dialogue,Miner,0,0,0,,Fugiți!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.44,0:01:58.67,Dialogue,Anna's Father,0,0,0,,O vrăjitoare!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.45,0:02:01.44,Dialogue,Anna's Father,0,0,0,,Tu ești o vrăjitoare!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.00,Dialogue,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mori, vrăjitoare nenorocită!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.99,0:02:29.85,Dialogue,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Mori!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.41,0:02:32.66,Dialogue,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,E așa de tânără.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.66,0:02:33.82,Dialogue,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Cine ar fi crezut...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.31,Dialogue,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Ardeți-o pe rug!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.71,0:02:41.51,Dialogue,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoare blestemată!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.42,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,Alteța Sa chiar e ocupat!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.42,0:02:50.62,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,Nu are timp nici \Nmăcar să dea verdictul.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.24,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,Carter, crezi că
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.24,0:02:56.27,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,Alteța Sa se va ridica \Ndin pat de data asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.82,0:03:04.17,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,Ei bine, Cetatea Hotarele e \Ndestul de pustie și izolată,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.17,0:03:06.06,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,iar cu o vrăjitoare \Ncare face probleme,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.06,0:03:08.39,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,nu prea cred că Alteța Sa își \Ndorește să zăbovească pe aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.54,Dialogue,Boris,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să ne întoarcem \Nde grabă la Castelul Sur.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.23,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Tyre.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.67,Dialogue,Tyre,0,0,0,,Lordule Barov.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.71,0:03:27.56,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Unde e Alteța Sa?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.01,0:03:30.66,Dialogue,Tyre,0,0,0,,Alteța Sa... încă doarme.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.83,0:03:33.94,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.09,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.77,0:03:37.44,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,A-Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.48,0:03:42.52,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, e timpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.12,0:04:01.05,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.02,0:04:02.99,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:03.69,0:04:06.10,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, treziți-vă! Treziți-vă!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.21,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.43,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.43,0:04:15.63,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Unde...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.29,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,{\an8}E timpul pentru execuția vrăjitoarei.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.26,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,{\an8}Toată lumea așteaptă \Nverdictul dumneavoastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.31,0:04:23.77,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Verdictul?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.42,0:04:25.86,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce verdict?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.17,0:04:28.16,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Visez cumva?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.27,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.78,0:04:32.57,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Totul... Totul pare atât de real!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.31,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.18,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.64,0:04:42.31,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.82,0:04:45.99,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.52,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Sunteți bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.38,0:04:54.59,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Barov.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.37,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Tu ești Barov.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.37,0:04:59.68,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Da, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.68,0:05:03.75,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Așa este. Eu sunt Barov, \Nservitorul dumneavoastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.23,0:05:06.67,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,E timpul pentru execuție, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.67,0:05:07.94,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Haideți să ieșim pe balcon.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.60,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voi observa situația deocamdată.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.39,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, s-a întâmplat ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.13,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Să mergem, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.87,0:05:35.77,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce s-a întâmplat cu mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.94,Dialogue,Crowd,0,0,0,,Prințul își face apariția!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.65,0:06:18.38,Dialogue,Crowd,0,0,0,,Prințule!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.02,Dialogue,Guard,0,0,0,,Tăcere!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.31,Dialogue,Crowd,0,0,0,,Spânzurați-o! Spânzurați-o!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.87,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,{\i1}O-O vrăjitoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.18,0:06:43.10,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, vă rugăm \Nsă dați verdictul repede.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.10,0:06:46.23,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ea este... vrăjitoare de care vorbeai?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.23,0:06:47.80,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Așa este, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.31,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}O vânătoare de vrăjitoare...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.02,0:06:53.34,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu... asta e mult prea absurd.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.64,0:06:58.95,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Sunt obosit. Amânați verdictul. \NApoi trimiteți-i pe toți acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.95,0:06:59.54,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.42,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță, asta nu e de glumă.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.97,0:07:04.90,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoarele trebuie eliminate \Nimediat cum sunt găsite.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.99,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Altfel vor atrage alte vrăjitoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.99,0:07:10.18,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Carter... Lannis.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.27,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Da, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.56,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Să vedem... Cavalerul șef.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.26,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.03,0:07:20.87,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Nu-ți este teamă, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.70,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Nu ar fi mai bine să vină mai multe vrăjitoare, ca să le prindem pe toate deodată?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.73,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.82,Dialogue,Crowd,0,0,0,,Prințule, de ce nu o \Nspânzurați pe vrăjitoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.19,0:10:09.95,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Un prinț pe care nu te poți baza.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.66,0:10:12.52,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Un teritoriu fără vreo importanță.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.37,0:10:15.24,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}O societate lipsită de cultură și educație.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.44,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}O eră a întunericului și ignoranței.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.80,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}O luptă neașteptată pentru tron.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.98,0:10:28.96,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare ce aș putea realiza... \Nîn această lume haotică?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.73,0:10:57.26,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Din moment ce sunt deja aici, \Nvoi face tot ce pot.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.28,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Din această zi,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.27,0:11:08.70,Dialogue,Roland OS,0,0,0,,{\i1}eu sunt Roland Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.78,0:11:15.59,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Bună dimineața, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.96,0:11:19.04,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,M-ați chemat, Alteță?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.57,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ia un loc, Barov.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.42,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.86,0:11:36.48,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, de ce nu ați ordonat ca \Nvrăjitoarea de ieri să fie executată?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.48,0:11:39.07,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Asta e o chestiune extrem de \Nimportantă ce nu poate fi amânată.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.76,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Serios? De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.70,0:11:45.95,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Gărzile au raportat apariția unor \Nvrăjitoare suspecte în Pădurea de Vest.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.11,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Acolo au găsit asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.09,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Emblema Muntelui Sacru \Nși a Ochiului Magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.09,0:11:54.01,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,E însemnul Asociației de \NConlucrare a Vrăjitoarelor.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.01,0:11:56.60,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Asociația de Conlucrare a \NVrăjitoarelor? Ce mai e și asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.85,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,O organizație a vrăjitoarelor.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.85,0:12:02.06,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Înainte să fie formată, \Nvrăjitoarele acționau pe cont propriu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.06,0:12:03.50,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Dar Asociația e diferită.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.99,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Vrea să unească toate vrăjitoarele
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.39,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,pentru a găsi așa-zisul Munte Sfânt.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.30,0:12:11.39,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Muntele... Sfânt?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.39,0:12:16.00,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Se zvonește că-și pot găsi pacea veșnică doar dacă vor merge pe Muntele Sfânt.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.00,0:12:20.70,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Ca să-și atingă scopul, Asociația ademenește activ femei care să devină vrăjitoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.81,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Îți amintești că anul trecut dispăruse un \Ngrup de copile din Portul Apei Limpezi, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.81,0:12:25.94,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Se zvonește că vrăjitoarele \Nsunt responsabile.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.36,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ți-e teamă că Asociația va afla că încă este în viață și va veni s-o salveze.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.45,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Așa este, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.45,0:12:34.52,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Aceste vrăjitoare eretice \Nar răpi chiar și bebeluși.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.19,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Probabil nu și-ar abandona \Nun camarad capturat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.55,0:12:40.43,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, acea vrăjitoare trebuie \Nexecutată cât mai repede.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.43,0:12:43.06,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Va fi o problemă dacă alte \Nvrăjitoare îi vor veni în ajutor.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.06,0:12:47.04,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Când o femeie devine vrăjitoare, \Naceasta obține puteri înfricoșătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.04,0:12:50.25,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Chiar și cavalerilor \Nle-ar fi greu să-i facă față.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.74,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ai spus că are puteri.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.10,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Care sunt puterile ei?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.10,0:12:55.65,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Și cum ați prins-o?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.65,0:12:58.52,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Acum câteva zile, \NMina Versantului Nordic s-a prăbușit.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.61,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Femeia a folosit vrăjitoria \Nși și-a dezvăluit identitatea.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.61,0:13:02.94,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ce fel de vrăjitorie?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.94,0:13:06.26,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,A dezlănțuit flăcările iadului
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.26,0:13:07.94,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,și a ars de viu un om.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.94,0:13:10.31,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Victima s-a topit precum ceara,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.31,0:13:14.44,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,capul și corpul acesteia \Nîmprăștiindu-se pe pământ.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:14.44,0:13:17.63,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Nu e ceva ce v-ați dori să vedeți.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.63,0:13:21.62,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Așadar, Alteță, haideți să ne ocupăm cât mai repede de această vrăjitoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.30,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Du-mă la ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.44,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,C-Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.73,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Vreți s-o vedeți pe vrăjitoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:27.70,0:13:28.55,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.74,0:13:31.68,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.94,0:13:33.84,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.07,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Așteptați. Așteptați, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.12,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Dar de ce să fie executată \Nprin spânzurare?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.44,0:13:46.63,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoarele nu sunt de regulă executate prin ardere pe rug?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.63,0:13:47.44,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.90,0:13:51.44,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Dar această vrăjitoare \Nnu se teme de foc.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.81,0:13:55.06,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță, e mult prea periculos.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.16,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Avem de-a face cu o vrăjitoare malefică.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.16,0:14:00.69,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă poartă la gât Medalionul Represaliilor Divine, nu vă putem garanta siguranța.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.04,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Dacă nu poți înfrunta răul, \Ncum intenționezi să-l învingi?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.63,0:14:07.08,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Cavalerul șef din subordinea \Nmea ar trebui să știe asta deja.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.68,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Un cavaler trebuie \Nsă-și cunoască limitele.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.11,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Nesăbuința nu înseamnă curaj.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.11,0:14:13.32,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Deci spui că dreptatea ar trebui aplicată asupra celor slabi,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.32,0:14:15.68,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,iar cei puternici să fie scutiți?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.41,0:14:18.76,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Nu, Alteță. Nu asta voiam să spun.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.53,0:15:28.53,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Liniștește-te, Carter. Pe loc repaus.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.53,0:15:30.06,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Dar, Alteță...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.86,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Cum te numești?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.57,0:15:35.10,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Eu sunt lordul Cetății Hotarele
Dialogue: 99,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.96,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,și al patrulea prinț al Regatului \NCastelului Sur, Roland Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.98,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Tu cine ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.98,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Ana.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.59,0:15:46.31,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Domnișoară Ana, ce s-a \Nîntâmplat în mină, în acea zi?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.31,0:15:48.48,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Aș dori să-mi povestești în detaliu.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.86,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Tatăl meu este miner.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.84,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Se afla în mină când aceasta începuse să se prăbușească.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.78,0:16:03.01,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Așa că am intrat \Nalergând ca să-l găsesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.98,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Din cauza prăbușirii,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.76,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,tatăl meu a fost prins sub pietre.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.48,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Alt miner care încerca să scape alături de el
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.97,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,a încercat să-i fure punguța cu monede pe care o avea la el.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.07,0:16:17.94,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Acele monede erau economiile de-o viață ale tatălui meu,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.60,0:16:21.48,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,singurii noștri bani.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.28,0:16:25.85,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Așa că tatăl meu \Na încercat să-l oprească.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.35,0:16:28.85,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Când i-am găsit,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.85,0:16:33.55,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,l-am văzut pe miner cu târnăcopul \Nridicat, pregătit să-mi omoare tatăl.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.41,0:16:39.31,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Așa că... l-am omorât eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.28,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Atunci cum ai fost prinsă?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.30,0:16:48.80,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Cineva m-a raportat.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.19,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ai fost raportată? De cine?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.23,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,De către tatăl ei, Alteță.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.42,0:16:59.23,Dialogue Overlap,Roland,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.90,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Tatăl ei a raportat-o?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.77,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Probabil pentru recompensă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.77,0:17:10.12,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Cei ce descoperă și ne \Nraportează vrăjitoarele
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.75,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,primesc 25 de monede de aur.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.75,0:17:14.72,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Pentru un adult cu un picior rupt,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.72,0:17:17.91,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,acea sumă îi va ajunge \Npentru tot restul vieții.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.34,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ai omorât un bărbat în toată firea.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.91,0:17:25.51,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Cum ai reușit s-o faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.81,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Cu ceea ce voi numiți...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.08,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,puterea diavolului.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.73,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Serios? Puterea diavolului?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.05,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Mi-o poți arăta?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.01,0:17:37.74,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.74,0:17:41.49,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, puterile ei sunt reprimate de Piatra Represaliilor Divine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.14,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Dacă și-ar dezlănțui puterile, \Nconsecințele ar fi inimaginabile.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.79,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,E prima oară când întâlniți \No vrăjitoare, prințule?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.87,0:17:50.75,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Curiozitatea s-ar \Nputea să vă vină de hac.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.75,0:17:54.39,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Dacă ești cu adevărat un demon nefast, nu eu ar trebui să mor.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.17,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ci tatăl tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.49,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță. Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.02,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță, ce încercați să faceți?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.23,0:18:13.94,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.94,0:18:16.08,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță, ce încercați să faceți?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.19,0:18:22.09,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Vreau să văd.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.77,0:18:24.99,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ești o biată fată sărmană
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.73,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,sau un demon iscusit \Nîn arta prefăcătoriei?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.31,0:18:29.66,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Arată-mi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.14,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:55.36,0:18:57.54,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță, haideți să ieșim de aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.54,0:18:58.73,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Nu, Carter!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:58.73,0:19:00.17,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Așteaptă, privește!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.88,0:19:01.98,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Ce mai e de văzut?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.48,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Flăcările...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.21,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Flăcările nu se extind.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.92,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Ea le controlează.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.92,0:19:11.98,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Nu dorește să ne rănească.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.73,Dialogue,Carter,0,0,0,,Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.86,0:19:19.85,Dialogue,Barov,0,0,0,,Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.81,0:19:59.81,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Ești mulțumit, prințule?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.54,0:20:03.31,Dialogue,Anna,0,0,0,,Mă poți ucide acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.39,0:20:24.39,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Nu, domnișoară Ana.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.17,Dialogue,Roland,0,0,0,,Vreau să te recrutez.
